hey are literally predators that have to feed on the life's blood of living creatures to survive.<br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure all the games have something like this. Chronicles of Darkness is a horror franchise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-16T22:58:42-08:00","id":831520,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">\u200bPlease stop threadcrapping. If you don't like horror settings the CofD forums really isn't the place to be expressing that.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Yes, yes, yes... I know it is a horror game.","edited":{"userid":11,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","user":"Darksider","date":". 02-17-2016, 04:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11143-feonorx","name":"Feonorx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T00:48:11-08:00","id":831568,"title":"","content":"Man, you might want to take a deep breath and let things go for a couple of days, because the way you're answering now does not make justice to the sort of maturity and good will you showed previously.<br /> <br /> It's not even done with a purpose in mind, except the one of sarcastically burning all bridges around you. And no, &quot;I sorta got picked on in the Mage's forum&quot; is not an excuse. Do yourself a favor and let it go, at least for the time necessary to calm down a bit.","signature":"